{"summary":"Mystery puzzle game","description":"Come discover beautiful mysterious machines of extra-terrestrial origins and use your logic and sense of observation to fix them; and uncover a galaxy-spanning story.\n\nMachinika Museum is a puzzle game for people who like to have their brain teased and love a nice story to go along. Do you like The Room? Myst? The Witness? Machinarium? Escape games? Do you like finding out what is behind a locked door? So do we! \n\nKey features:\n\n•        Mind bending Puzzles: use your sharp logic skills and your sense of observation\n•        Mysterious atmosphere and story: there is so much you don't know about yet...\n•        Wonderful visuals, cryptic alien machines have never looked better\n•        Intuitive and enjoyable touch controls. Why make it complicated?\n•        Available in English, French, Spanish, German and Italian\n\nWhat are these machines? Who sent them? And why won't anyone give you answers? You will have to find for yourself. In this far future, finding machines from alien civilizations is not unusual, especially in a museum dedicated to them. But this time it looks like something deeper is hidden from you...","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$4.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-Qv4TphAIJw?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Qay4Xf0mm8pQwQ5zXOyGneBoKsVIm7WgkrXw6iJq63xGlMEqc87CziKDe9KlzWC4rYPTs2SKzwMlY2CgI7ej","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QjzV5Uq80m_bFD0SQ44-f09xuqqzfZ9Y5uIrBLJYBm7S_z2nle7-Yg6OdlI_xbIo9jCQyFfPhjNrvpyUfc4yBQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/I9KqZZ7qp8GPvhazf-W5QGDnSMufX-SYE6EY_wqMu5kB5_4AOT5NgCEvt0IAqBA9LrTZqXTMVD9B9NGSzDpQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/H4dAkvpedkCln8oYoSaxUMdPgRxUHTY0cVw8SqIEDAGfh1RamZcXqMFQ05pk1qL9PqZh_yUTZCw0NrTI0iqp62w","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7qFmOpdOeLAIKJWL1vPiHFeY6IEWEwoWX0j9xcNfIPXPRt3MTSMBMbZMrYAGkLeTYEWVQiVEzGhPY9L0WCw7lbE","